fixture tech12_kindle_dash
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 12 "Kindle-dash (universal with the Kindle Votive): dash through a wax wall or a Snuffed to ignite it"
room test/wax
spawn 700 544
option kindle 1
frames 40
input
  0 R dash
  1..39 R
end
expect
  # The wax wall (800..832) ignites as the dash reaches it, and the dash carries straight on.
  mark lit 0..8 event.ignite=1
  never 0..8 hit_wall=1
  at 8 x=880u state=dash
  # Past it, the wall stays open.
  at 20 x>900u
end
